./_gen.sh s184-desk "$BASE The middle band of the frame (from 35% to 75% of the height): a long dark matte desk seen straight from the front with four objects standing in one evenly spaced row, each under its own small warm spotlight, clearly separated by empty dark space: 1) a smartphone standing upright showing an abstract chat with speech bubbles, a small headset resting beside it; 2) a vertical smartphone on a small tripod with a round ring light behind it, screen showing a paused vertical video with a tiny play icon; 3) a neat stack of printed ad posters with bold abstract colour blocks, one card leaning against the stack; 4) a tablet showing an abstract social feed with a heart icon, a small brass megaphone lying in front of it. The upper 35% of the frame is nearly black and empty for typography; the bottom 25% is a plain dark desk surface, empty, for captions." &
./_gen.sh s184-button "$BASE In the centre of the frame a large round physical yellow (#FDD506) push button with a brass rim sits on a dark matte console and glows softly, a faint ring of yellow light spreading around it. From the button four thin glowing yellow light lines lead outward to four small objects floating in the dark, evenly placed at the upper-left, upper-right, lower-left and lower-right of the button, with empty dark space around each object for captions: upper-left a smartphone with abstract chat bubbles; upper-right a vertical smartphone on a small tripod with a ring light showing a paused video; lower-left a small stack of printed ad cards with abstract colour blocks; lower-right a tablet with an abstract social feed and a small brass megaphone. The top 22% of the frame is nearly black and empty for typography. No hands." &
