./_gen_ref.sh s185-vlad "Photoreal cinematic still, square 1:1. The man from the reference photo (platinum-blond short hair, full brown beard, black t-shirt) sits at a dark desk and speaks a short command into his smartphone held close to his mouth, relaxed, slight smile, face clearly recognizable, three-quarter view from the side. From the phone a small glowing yellow (#FDD506) waveform rises into the air. Deep coffee-brown shadows (#0B0907), single warm key light, subtle yellow glow from the phone. The upper 40% of the frame is nearly black and empty for typography. No readable text, no logos, no watermark." ../photo/vlad-avatar.jpg &
